  '2–4 People', 'Contains all core non-perishable samagri, sacred photos, and Katha book needed for a simple and authentic family Satyanarayan Pooja.', '"Core deities photos & Katha book","Traditional roli, haldi & kumkum","Akshat rice (100g) & premium dry coconut","Janeu, Mauli thread & Supari (11 pcs)","Gangajal (100ml) & sweet batasha/mishri offerings","Steel Kalash, clay diyas & essential pooja cloths"', NULL, 0, true
