VALUES ('8f6ca28c-84ed-50ed-9709-784b6d62e041', 'c21ca8ed-8f4a-5fe2-8339-088ce2ae771f', 'Are the Yantras included energized?', 'Yes. The Standard kit features an energized brass-plated Mahamrityunjaya Yantra, and the Premium kit upgrades this to a premium copper-etched Mahamrityunjaya Yantra. Both are purified and energized in Varanasi temples by priests.', 1)
